NOTE ON SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE
=============================

This MIT license covers the SOURCE CODE in this repository only.

- The research write-ups (research/PAPER_DRAFT.md, the decision records under
  brain/decisions/ and research/*_decision.md, and the campaign registry) are
  the authors' own analysis and are shared for reading/citation; attribution is
  appreciated.

- This repository does NOT include, and does not relicense, any third-party
  market data. The option-quote lakes are derived from ThetaData (a licensed
  vendor) and are excluded from distribution; CEF universe data derived from
  Tiingo is likewise excluded. See docs/DATA.md for provenance
  and how to obtain or recreate the inputs yourself under those vendors' terms.

- Nothing here is investment advice. The campaign's conclusion is that no
  deployable edge survived testing on retail-accessible data; the code and
  results are provided for research and educational purposes only.
